        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs the manifest. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The run has three steps, in this order. The function validates the manifest through <ref refid="struct_validator" kindref="compound">Validator</ref>. It runs every <computeroutput>## toolchain</computeroutput> row through <ref refid="struct_processor_1a6ace9660425275f32080160c0ae88b2b" kindref="member">run()</ref>. It then runs the epochs and writes the report, when the manifest holds a <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_processor_1a6ace9660425275f32080160c0ae88b2b" kindref="member">run</ref></computeroutput> table. Each step runs only when the earlier steps succeed.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="classjuce_1_1Result_1ac2133128eeba510367bfe1b83383ae0f" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::Result::ok()</ref> when every step succeeds, or the first failure. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
