    <briefdescription>
<para>Owns the parsed manifest of one scout run and drives the run through it. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="struct_processor" kindref="compound">Processor</ref> parses the manifest file once, at construction. <ref refid="struct_processor_1ac2f8ddc17ef15f47f03fa71ce3d381c6" kindref="member">generate()</ref> then validates the manifest and runs the <computeroutput>## toolchain</computeroutput> rows. When the manifest holds a <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_processor_1a6ace9660425275f32080160c0ae88b2b" kindref="member">run</ref></computeroutput> table, <ref refid="struct_processor_1ac2f8ddc17ef15f47f03fa71ce3d381c6" kindref="member">generate()</ref> also runs the epochs and writes the report. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
